      "content": "Which ONE of the following compounds has the HIGHEST vapour pressure?\n\nA $\\text{HCOOH}$\nB $\\text{CH}_3\\text{CHO}$\nC $\\text{CH}_3\\text{CH}_2\\text{OH}$\nD $\\text{CH}_3\\text{CH}_2\\text{CH}_3$"
